                  {
                    "id": "intro-text",
                    "component": "Text",
                    "variant": "body",
                    "text": "South Lake Union has some fantastic options for a fresh lunch salad. Here are 5 highly-rated spots where you can find delicious and healthy bowls:\n\n1.  **Portage Bay Cafe**: A local favorite known for its seasonal, organic, and sustainable ingredients. Their lunch menu features hearty salads like the Cobb and the Beet & Goat Cheese.\n2.  **Bounty Kitchen**: A modern health-focused eatery specializing in high-quality organic ingredients. They are famous for their 'Big Bowls' and diverse salad options like the Flagship Kale Bowl.\n3.  **Sizzle&Crunch SLU**: If you're looking for a Vietnamese twist, their fresh bowls allow you to customize with plenty of greens, pickled veggies, and flavorful proteins.\n4.  **Duke's Seafood**: While known for seafood, Duke's offers premium salads like their 'Award Winning' Chowder and salad combos or the Wild Child Grilled Salmon Salad.\n5.  **Bleuwiches**: A great casual spot that offers fresh sandwiches and a variety of healthy, fresh salads perfect for a quick workday lunch."
                  },
